## Reference Implementations (Python & Java)

```python
# Little's Law concurrency estimator (Python)
def required_concurrency(target_rps: float, p95_latency_ms: float) -> float:
    # L = lambda * W
    return target_rps * (p95_latency_ms / 1000.0)
```

```java
// Little's Law concurrency estimator (Java)
public static double requiredConcurrency(double targetRps, double p95LatencyMs) {
    return targetRps * (p95LatencyMs / 1000.0);
}
```
